libvc
------------------------------------------
The libvc library is a C library for accessing and manipulating vCard files.
This package contains only the shared libraries for use by applications that
need them at run-time.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  libvc-devel-013-1bl1
  libvc0-013-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.5-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-15-3
  automake-20250528-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  bison-3.8.2-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  flex-2.6.4-2
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libvc/libvc

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libvc/libvc/archive/refs/tags/v013.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libvc-013-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libvc-013-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libvc-013-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvc-013-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvc0-013-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvc-devel-013-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libvc)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libvc.README
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/COPYING.LIB
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/README
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/THANKS
  /usr/share/doc/libvc/TODO

(libvc0)
  /usr/bin/cygvc-0.dll

(libvc-devel)
  /usr/include/vc.h
  /usr/lib/libvc.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libvc.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/vc.3.gz

